To design a classic Minesweeper game with a 9x9 grid containing 10 hidden mines, we will implement the game using Python with a graphical user interface (GUI) using the `tkinter` library. The game will consist of several core components, each encapsulated in classes and functions. Below is the outline of the core classes and functions:

### Core Classes and Functions

